files:  ls cat cp mv rm mkdir rmdir
        pwd stat hexdump edit head more
        touch
text:   echo grep wc tee tail sort
system: ps kill jobs fg bg free df
        uptime date uname version
        sleep clear theme
users:  login whoami passwd
code:   basic as
disks:  mount umount format
shell:  a | b  > f  >> f  < f  cmd &
        a ; b  *.bas  cd  exit
keys:   | is shift + - (in vice: the | key)
        run/stop interrupts a command
        ctrl-z stops it: fg, bg resume
